---
// HowItWorks section - 3-step horizontal timeline with animated connectors
---

<section class="how" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="how-header" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="how-heading" class="section-heading heading-glow">
        Empieza en <span class="gradient-text">tres pasos</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        No necesitas ser experto en finanzas. WalletWise está diseñado para que cualquiera pueda empezar en minutos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="how-steps" data-reveal-stagger>
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <polyline points="17 11 19 13 23 9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="step-title">Crea tu cuenta</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Regístrate en segundos con tu email. Sin datos bancarios, sin complicaciones. Solo tú y tus finanzas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="connector-line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/>
              <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="step-title">Registra tus movimientos</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Añade ingresos y gastos con categorías. Un par de clics y tu historial financiero empieza a tomar forma.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="connector-line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="step-title">Toma el control</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Visualiza tus patrones, detecta fugas de dinero y optimiza tus gastos con gráficos claros y estadísticas detalladas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .how-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .how-steps {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .step {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Big step number — Linear style */
  .step-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .step:hover .step-number {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(52,211,153,0.06) 0%, transparent 55%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .step:hover .step-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(52,211,153,0.18), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .step:hover .step-card::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .step-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 8%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .step:hover .step-icon {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 14%, transparent);
  }

  .step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  /* Animated connectors */
  .step-connector {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .connector-line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 1px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Animated green pulse through the connector */
  .connector-line::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--color-accent), transparent);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    animation: shimmer 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .how-steps {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .step {
      max-width: 360px;
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .step-number {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .step-connector {
      width: 1.5px;
      height: 28px;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .connector-line {
      width: 1.5px;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .connector-line::after {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--color-accent), transparent);
      transform: translateY(-100%);
      animation: shimmer-vertical 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  }

  @keyframes shimmer-vertical {
    0% { transform: translateY(-100%); }
    100% { transform: translateY(200%); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .how {
      padding: 4.5rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
